THE RESEARCH FINDING REPRODUCED HERE IS NOT ORIGINAL

The NLA paper already documents explanations containing "verifiably false claims
about the context" that are "typically thematically faithful". This repository
reproduces that and asks a different question -- whether those claims correspond
to active SAE features. See RESULTS.md.
